study("Bollinger Band Ribbon R2.1 by JustUncleL",overlay=true, shorttitle="s ")

//
// Author:    JustUncleL
// Revision:  R2.0
// Date:      25-Nov-2017
//
//
// Description:
//  This study is a Bollingar Band indicator that shows the fractional stddev levels between
//  the main bands. You can choose upto 6 Stddev Main Levels (ie 6*StdDev), with 0,1,3,4, or 9
//  fractional levels. 
//
//  Options Available:
//  ------------------
//  1) Can use different MA types for Basis of BB/KC : SMA, EMA, WMA and VWMA are good choices.
//    
//    - SMA     = Simple Moving Average.
//    - EMA     = Exponential Moving Average.
//    - WMA     = Weighted Moving Average
//    - VWMA    = Volume Weighted Moving Average
//    - SMMA    = Smoothed Simple Moving Average.
//    - DEMA    = Double Exponential Moving Average
//    - TEMA    = Triple Exponential Moving Average.
//    - HullMA  = Hull Moving Average
//    - SSMA    = Ehlers Super Smoother Moving average
//    - SWMA    = Symetrical weighted MA with fixed length 4: wghts=[1/6,2/6,2/6,1/6]
//    - ZEMA    = Near Zero Lag Exponential Moving Average.
//    - TMA     = Triangular (smoothed) Simple Moving Average.
//
//  2) Option to display coloured Candles around the Ribbon, the coulouring uses
//    the Standard candle colours:
//    - Lime    = candle closed above Ribbon.
//    - Red     = candle closed below Ribbon.
//    - Gray    = Candle Closed inside Ribbon.
//    the Grab candles scheme:
//    - Lime    = Bull candle closed above Ribbon.
//    - Green   = Bear candle closed above Ribbon.
//    - Red     = Bull candle closed below Ribbon.
//    - DarkRed = Bear candle closed below Ribbon.
//    - Aqua    = Bull candle closed inside Ribbon.
//    - Blue    = Bear candle closed inside Ribbon.
// 
//  3) Show previous days closing price.
//
//  4) Show Previous days High and Low prices.
//
//  5) Option to base the candles on a higher time frame (HFT) emulation:
//     this performed by increasing the MA length to create equivalent lengths 
//     from the HFT. This is an emulation so will not be exact.
//     NOTE: The script will time out if the MA lengths get too long after resizing.
//
// Mofidifications:
//  0.# - alpha/beta versions
//
//  1.0 - original Public script
//
//  2.0 Requested options, similar to my other Channel indicators like MA Ribbon:
//      - Added Option to display coloured candles based on BB/KC channel breakout
//        conditions.
//      - Added Option to display only the Last Band when no SubLevels selected.
//      - Added Option to use Anchor Time Frame to emulate Higher Time frame results.
//      - Change some default colours.
//
//  2.1 - 12-Dec-2017
//      - Added optional ATR smoothing for KC style channels
//      - Added SWMA type moving average.
//
